Diet Planning Assistant
A fully functional, multi-turn conversational AI chatbot built with Python, LangChain, Gradio, and SQLite. This application acts as a personal diet planning assistant, helping users create balanced, sustainable meal plans based on their unique goals, preferences, and dietary restrictions while maintaining full conversation history and persistence across sessions.

Features
Multi-Turn Conversations: Maintains full conversational context by passing an ordered history of messages (System, Human, and AI) to the LLM with every request.

Database-Backed Persistence: Automatically saves every exchange to a local SQLite database using LangChain's SQLChatMessageHistory.

Session Management: Allows users to seamlessly create new chat sessions or load and switch between past conversations using a dynamic dropdown interface.

Interactive UI: Built with Gradio using a clean, modern soft theme (gr.Blocks), featuring a chat interface, real-time message handling, and session controls.

Structured System Instructions: Configured with explicit prompt engineering to ensure the assistant asks about one topic at a time, preventing user overwhelm.

Project Structure
Plaintext
├── logic.py      # Core chatbot logic, LangChain integration, and SQLite persistence
├── ui.py         # Gradio user interface layer and session event handlers
└── main.py       # Main entry point linking logic and UI together
Module Breakdown
1. Backend Logic (logic.py)
Handles model initialization via LangChain, system prompts, message history tracking, and SQLite database interactions.

DietChatBot class: Manages session creation (_initialize_session), message appending (get_response), history retrieval (get_messages), and querying past sessions (get_previous_conversations).

2. Persistent User Interface (ui.py)
Builds the front-end layout using Gradio and bridges user interactions with the backend chatbot instance.

PersistentChatBotUI class: Handles chat message submission (send_message_handler), new session creation (new_session_handler), history loading (load_session_handler), and dropdown state synchronization.

3. Main Application Entry Point (main.py)
Ties the modular components together to launch the application.

Python
from logic import DietChatBot
from ui import PersistentChatBotUI

# Initialize the chatbot backend
diet_chatbot = DietChatBot()

# Create and launch the UI with persistence
chatbot_ui = PersistentChatBotUI(diet_chatbot)
interface = chatbot_ui.create_ui()

# interface.launch()  # Uncomment to run locally
Installation & Setup
Clone the repository and navigate to the project directory.

Install dependencies:

Bash
pip install langchain langchain-core langchain-community gradio python-dotenv
Configure Environment Variables:
Create a .env file in the root directory and add your necessary API keys (e.g., OpenAI or platform-specific keys required by init_chat_model):

Code snippet
OPENAI_API_KEY="your-api-key-here"
Run the Application:
Uncomment interface.launch() in your main script and execute:

Bash
python main.py
